165	// update flows; a pack's installed version sits on that pack's own entry. Both were
166	// a nested `claudinite` block until #1252, alongside an `updated` datetime and a
167	// `ref` — those two held the provenance of the last FULL re-vendor rather than of
168	// this mount, so a member converging nightly read as months stale, and nothing may
169	// judge freshness by them any more because they no longer exist.
170	// `dailyClaudiniteUpdatesRequirePrReview` is the harsh override: true leaves this
171	// repo's daily update PR open for a human. Absent — the normal shape — means it
172	// lands on its own. It is an override rather than a materialized preference
