269	// Load and validate the project's settings. Validity is checked at load — the
270	// moment Claudinite reads the file — and every problem is collected into `errors`
271	// (each `{ what, fix }`), the runner's single settings-validity gate. A wrong
272	// property name, malformed JSON, and a wrong pack name are all equally settings
273	// errors; unknown *pack* names need the registry, so the runner adds those (it
274	// holds the known-pack list). On unparsable/misshaped JSON the usable fields fall
275	// back to empty so the rest of a sweep still runs, with the error reported.
276	//
277	// The returned shape is NORMALIZED: `packs` is plain BARE ids (a local pack's
278	// namespaced `local/<id>` token resolves through packEntryId, so every
279	// downstream lookup — packEntries, the packConfig view — keys by the pack's
280	// own id whichever form the file used), `rules` and `accept` are the top-level
281	// and per-entry settings merged (an entry-sourced acceptance carries
282	// `pack: <id>` as provenance; conflicting severity overrides are a settings
283	// error), and `packConfig` is the per-pack parameter view, built from each
284	// entry's `config`. Checks and env machinery
285	// read this one shape regardless of which form the file used.
