508	    // kind of bug, legal to write and impossible to read: it is what made the
509	    // stamp invisible to the scheduler and silently killed baselining fleet-wide,
510	    // every repo self-skipping as "no vendored mount" while its runs went green.
511	    // The CONFIG_KEYS-survive-loadConfig test pins the whole set.
512	    engineVersion,
513	    packVersions,
514	    // The harsh override, normalized to the boolean every caller asks for and named
