519	    // The declaration exactly as the member wrote it. The engine normalizes what the
520	    // engine OWNS; a setting belonging to a pack is that pack's to read, and its
521	    // reader needs the unnormalized file — both to find a parameter on a pack entry
522	    // and to resolve a retired top-level spelling the engine deliberately no longer
523	    // folds. Every caller that has a shape to ask about should ask its owner's
524	    // predicate, not reach in here.
525	    raw,
526	    errors,
527	  };
